# 1.4.10: low latency
rago.module.low_latency=Low Latency
rago.module.low_latency.desc=Keeps the graphics card's queue of frames short, the idea behind NVIDIA Reflex: before reading your mouse for a new frame, the game waits until the card has drawn the earlier ones, so what you see is built from fresher input. Can cost some FPS, most in Strict.
rago.option.latency_mode=Mode
rago.option.latency_mode.balanced=Balanced (at most 1 frame waiting)
rago.option.latency_mode.strict=Strict (no frame waiting)
rago.option.latency_mode.help=Strict gives the lowest delay but the processor and the graphics card take turns, so FPS can drop. Balanced keeps almost all your FPS.

